<mei xmlns="http://www.music-encoding.org/ns/mei" meiversion="5.0"><meiHead xml:lang="en"><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Mod 7-167v-8</title></titleStmt><pubStmt><identifier>https://corpus-monodicum.de/d/f76892d6-8313-43c0-a704-31819f720eba</identifier><respStmt><corpName role="publisher">Corpus Monodicum</corpName></respStmt><address><addrLine>Domerschulstraße 13</addrLine><addrLine>97070 Würzburg</addrLine></address><availability><useRestrict auth.uri="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/">CC BY-NC 4.0</useRestrict></availability><date isodate="2026-11-04"/></pubStmt><seriesStmt><title>Corpus Monodicum</title><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Michael Klaper</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Edition (Tropen)</resp><persName>Andreas Pfisterer</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Gunilla Iversen</persName></respStmt><respStmt><resp>Text revision (Tropen)</resp><persName>Ritva Maria Jacobsson</persName></respStmt><funder>Akademie der Wissenschaften und der Literatur Mainz</funder></seriesStmt><notesStmt><annot startid="#m-a8569649-a50e-4061-8869-d378ba2db5e1" endid="#m-8f4f79da-4cc8-4686-baa7-b7be1282152b"><table><tr><td><rend>((scinus))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((sinus))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-0e9ee3c8-2404-46bc-88ea-93a54ee7a937" endid="#m-d6177c8c-4567-45cd-9683-26d8d031b8c9"><table><tr><td><rend>[[&lt;G&gt;audeamus]]</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Initiale nicht ausgeführt.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-d1497e81-6a84-4eb4-bf8d-5ec1d022fd70" endid="#m-1379e21b-79b1-4a54-a335-06524b11de24" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>[[honore]]</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>[[honorem]]</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ed0e1152-5ad9-45f6-bdcf-bf2c61a00447" endid="#m-8c3944f2-ffe3-45bf-aaf0-da5ff546d10b"><table><tr><td><rend>[[on&lt;o&gt;r&lt;e&gt;]]</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies [[honore]]</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-45a930b8-0d2b-4b41-97dd-327a3643889f" endid="#m-806c80f7-e014-48ee-83b4-79294ac663bb" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((finita uirgo))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((sanctis finita uirgo)), ((sanctis)) o.N., vermutlich korrigiert aus ((sanctissima uirgo uirginum)), regulär notiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-0e184a35-1d52-49c6-86fb-3884066cb68a" endid="#m-4821c556-259e-42b1-828a-bc6d2f1f468d"><table><tr><td><rend>((letantur))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Text auf Rasur.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-169f78fe-f441-4eec-a569-c017e71f3664" endid="#m-efbc6cfb-6457-42ef-9227-405fde44dad7"><table><tr><td><rend>((atque archangeli eia))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Text möglicherweise von anderer Hand auf Rasur, regulär notiert. Auf der nächsten Zeile folgt (o.N.): ((-stro canentes)). Offenbar wurde vor dem Eintrag der Notation der Text von ((Gaud 140)) auf den nur hier überlieferten Text ((Gaud 152)) korrigiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-c466e0a2-b1b4-4852-bb0d-3d6e0f9f7d8e" endid="#m-a2ea848d-c3a7-4b75-b0f9-cf56b0922e94"><table><tr><td><rend>((De))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Text vermutlich korrigiert, regulär notiert.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-4fefaa71-208a-4491-af10-28a1653fc653" endid="#m-f34d038e-26ad-4bcd-bd8a-b33077e986db" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((Quam)) (wie ((CT IX)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((Quan))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>Elemente 145 und 54 radiert, aber weitgehend lesbar. Elemente 152-155 teilweise auf Rasur. Der Text von 152 integriert nicht radierte Worte aus dem offenbar ursprünglich notierten Text 140 (((Hodie sanctissima uirgo uirginum))). Am Ende ist das Textfragment ((stro canentes)) aus 140 stehen geblieben, nur die Notation ist ausradiert. Bei den übrigen Elementen lässt sich der ursprüngliche Text nicht erkennen.</rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-mod-7"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Mod 7</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Mod 7-167v-8</identifier><title>Nos sinus ecclesiae matris</title><incip><incipText><p>Nos sinus ecclesiae matris</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="167v">f. 167v, l. 8</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>Gaud 53 A 145 B 54 C D E F 152 A 153 B 154 C 155 D (CT IX)</bibl><bibl type="printed-edition">II-4</bibl></biblList><classification><termList><term type="genre">Tropus</term><term type="genre">Introitus-Tropus</term><term type="feast">Assumptio Mariae</term><term type="feast">Messe</term><term type="Editor">Michael Klaper</term><term type="Bezugsgesang">Gaudeamus</term><term type="Endseite">168</term><term type="Endzeile">4</term><term type="Band_Genre">Tropus</term></termList></classification></work></workList><manifestationList><manifestation><identifier type="siglum">Mod 7</identifier><identifier type="cantus">Mod 7</identifier><titleStmt><title>Mod 7</title></titleStmt><creation><geogName role="origin">Forlimpopoli</geogName><geogName role="origin-region">Quellen italienischer Herkunft</geogName><date>11. Jh – 12. Jh</date></creation><langUsage><language xml:lang="la"/></langUsage><classification><termList><term type="quellentyp">Graduale mit Tropen und Sequenzen, Kyriale</term></termList></classification><itemList><item><identifier type="shelfmark">O.I.7</identifier><physLoc><repository><geogName role="settlement">Modena</geogName><corpName>Biblioteca Capitolare</corpName></repository></physLoc></item></itemList></manifestation></manifestationList><revisionDesc><change isodate="2026-11-04"><changeDesc><p>Exported with Monodi-Zero 0.9.1.</p></changeDesc></change></revisionDesc></meiHead><music><body><mdiv type="main"><score><scoreDef><staffGrp><staffDef n="1" notationtype="neume" lines="5" clef.shape="G" clef.line="2"/></staffGrp></scoreDef><section xml:id="m-c02fc402-be0b-4245-b147-7570f73ea37e"><section xml:id="m-f1cf36a8-f56b-4a2a-b6c6-d4ea51d72a8b"/><section xml:id="m-47eea55c-36f2-45d5-a6d4-c4d7b77ef1ce"/><section xml:id="m-57e1a62f-865f-4c9f-9a03-ab80b8970dff" label="53" type="Tropenelement"><sb xml:id="m-873a8821-5fde-41cf-98fe-9a2674d6a41e"/><staff n="1"><layer n="1"><annot xml:id="m-ca7462e9-20f4-4254-8b43-fdaed551088a" type="paratext" label="Festtag">IN DIE SANCTE MARIE (f. 167v)</annot><annot xml:id="m-d59eb445-ceca-4efd-9cd7-136e85539c11" type="paratext" label="Gesang">TROPHE</annot><syllable xml:id="m-3bfc3bc3-6b6f-4818-aa3f-405687818a9f"><syl wordpos="s">Nos</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-af4ba532-28d0-47f4-895f-1e28154032d0" pname="d" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-5a8d5598-5846-4644-a1b6-27c9fa1725d0" pname="c" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-ca1ed83b-8d35-4bde-acb2-f183b5cdbed0" pname="d" oct="4"/></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-58d687a7-8291-4d4c-adb4-e381844f744a"><syl wordpos="i" con="d">sci-</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-a8569649-a50e-4061-8869-d378ba2db5e1" pname="e" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-5586b861-0d45-47db-b9c6-f49a748c3911" pname="f" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-2acdc088-35c6-4929-a304-ae0ef9d1856c" pname="g" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-e08716a4-ee24-4598-82d6-8a53e0d3777a" pname="f" oct="4" con="g"/><nc xml:id="m-2901ad49-e420-4fe0-9d21-c7b50c00de74" pname="e" oct="4" con="g"/></neume><neume><nc xml:id="m-62ba6445-8ee7-4aaa-a2ac-9b85bbf91780" pname="d" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-afaa2256-c340-4280-9b59-f2d4e36a733d" pname="e" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-66911af2-fbe9-450a-b9d7-3e635c7d1218" pname="f" oct="4"/><nc xml:id="m-e3b2ef3d-0064-45ef-9819-654d1b0c7f7a" pname="d" oct="4"/></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-c3b36294-0507-4b6f-a11b-9a7611726da2"><syl wordpos="t">nus</syl><neume><nc xml:id="m-8f4f79